r law with the breaks at <strong>~0.14 and ~1.7 MJ</strong>....\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"971f93cd1e987fab\">>>", "published": "February 10, 2023", "siteName": "www.mdpi.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"32922c85df56084f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nr/space on Reddit: ‘Super-Earth’ discovered — and it’s a prime candidate for alien life\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"32922c85df56084f\">>>", "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/space/comments/1ibydxw/superearth_discovered_and_its_a_prime_candidate/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"27ba8ca4954650c2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThis &quot;super-Earth,&quot; <strong>approximately six times the mass of our planet</strong>, orbits within the habitable zone of its star, HD 20794, where conditions may allow for liquid water—a crucial ingredient for life.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"27ba8ca4954650c2\">>>", "published": "January 28, 2025", "siteName": "www.reddit.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775298753074}}
